 defaultsideoverlap allm3 metal3 allmvactivenonfet active 31.398

#metal3->poly
 defaultoverlap     allm3 metal3 allpolynonres active 11.850
 defaultsideoverlap allm3 metal3 allpolynonres active 31.943
